1
00:04:26,666 --> 00:04:32,666
An epic fantasy of peace and magic.

2
00:08:53,333 --> 00:08:59,333
Wizards is a animation, fantasy, science fiction film directed by Ralph Bakshi.

3
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:26,000
After the death of his mother, evil mutant wizard Blackwolf
discovers long-lost military technologies.

4
00:17:46,666 --> 00:17:52,666
Full of ego and ambition, Blackwolf claims his mother's throne,
assembles an army, and sets out to brainwash and conquer Earth.

5
00:22:13,333 --> 00:22:19,333
Meanwhile, Blackwolf's gentle twin brother, the bearded sage Avatar, calls upon his own magical abilities to foil
Blackwolf's plans for world domination — even if it means eliminating his own flesh and blood.

6
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:46,000
Avatar (voice), played by Bob Holt.

7
00:31:06,666 --> 00:31:12,666
Elinore (voice), played by Jesse Welles.

8
00:35:33,333 --> 00:35:39,333
Weehawk (voice), played by Richard Romanus.

9
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Peace (voice), played by David Proval.

10
00:44:26,666 --> 00:44:32,666
Sean (voice), played by Mark Hamill.

11
00:48:53,333 --> 00:48:59,333
President (voice), played by Jim Connell.

12
00:53:20,000 --> 00:53:26,000
Wizards is a 1977 American animated post-apocalyptic science fantasy film written,
directed and produced by Ralph Bakshi and distributed by 20th Century-Fox.

13
00:57:46,666 --> 00:57:52,666
The film follows a battle between two wizards of opposing powers, one representing the
forces of magic and the other representing the forces of technology.

14
01:02:13,333 --> 01:02:19,333
The film is notable for being the first fantasy film by Bakshi, a filmmaker who was previously known only
for "urban films" such as Fritz the Cat (1972), Heavy Traffic (1973) and Coonskin (1975).

15
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
The film grossed US$9 million theatrically with a $2 million budget.

16
01:11:06,666 --> 01:11:12,666
The film explores themes of assassin, nazi, elves, magic, technology.

17
01:15:33,333 --> 01:15:39,333
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking and mind_bending.
